​Slide 2: The Problem

​Code Review Bottlenecks: Engineering teams spend up to 20% of their time waiting for manual code reviews, slowing down product deployment.

​Inconsistent Code Quality: Human reviewers miss edge cases, security vulnerabilities, and style violations under tight deadlines.

​Developer Burnout: Senior engineers spend hours reviewing pull requests instead of building core features.


​Slide 3: The Solution

​Instant Automated PR Scans: DevPulse scans code pull requests in seconds using custom static analysis and fine-tuned LLMs.

​Context-Aware Feedback: Catches security bugs, performance leaks, and style mismatches directly in GitHub/GitLab comments.

​Accelerated Delivery: Reduces PR merge time by up to 60% while maintaining enterprise-grade code standards.


